    "name": "Cat Me If You Can",
    "steam_appid": 3170490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>BE PART OF OUR COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/c1a759a84f4ded24135fe405a85a0d5e.avif?t=1755076219\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Me If You Can takes you into black-and-white comic style 3D worlds filled with countless feline friends and charming secrets to discover and get lost in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/0dacf0e3aba0308b8feb684323ebd0d2.avif?t=1755076219\" width=610 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in cozy, handcrafted worlds teeming with charm. Seek out hidden cats and capture their adorable moments with your camera. <br>Stay sharp\u2014only the keenest observers can uncover the most cleverly concealed fluffballs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b3efa9804acf642f1f000458c3b7c4f1.poster.avif?t=1755076219\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b3efa9804acf642f1f000458c3b7c4f1.webm?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b3efa9804acf642f1f000458c3b7c4f1.mp4?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/a79eba7b596e077fa47d48d5336ef176.avif?t=1755076219\" width=610 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every cat is easy to spot! Some are hiding behind riddles, locked doors, or curious contraptions just waiting to be figured out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever puzzles, decode clues, and uncover hidden pathways to reveal even more elusive feline friends. Every puzzle you crack brings you one paw closer to completing your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b99d51f4a38299bf69c280c3290f26ba.poster.avif?t=1755076219\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b99d51f4a38299bf69c280c3290f26ba.webm?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b99d51f4a38299bf69c280c3290f26ba.mp4?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/392d037d629db64fae4da5687ec1cd71.avif?t=1755076219\" width=610 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind as you take a peaceful journey through atmospheric locations filled with charm and mystery, and, of course, cats. From the sun-soaked sands of Ancient Egypt to the intimate streets of modern Japan, and the quiet corners of majestic medieval castles, each destination invites you to slow down, look closer, and discover every hidden furball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/7bc731cb1b12a0a3701d45836e909636.poster.avif?t=1755076219\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/7bc731cb1b12a0a3701d45836e909636.webm?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/7bc731cb1b12a0a3701d45836e909636.mp4?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Me If You Can takes you into black-and-white comic style 3D worlds filled with countless feline friends and charming secrets to discover and get lost in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/0dacf0e3aba0308b8feb684323ebd0d2.avif?t=1755076219\" width=610 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in cozy, handcrafted worlds teeming with charm. Seek out hidden cats and capture their adorable moments with your camera. <br>Stay sharp\u2014only the keenest observers can uncover the most cleverly concealed fluffballs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b3efa9804acf642f1f000458c3b7c4f1.poster.avif?t=1755076219\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b3efa9804acf642f1f000458c3b7c4f1.webm?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b3efa9804acf642f1f000458c3b7c4f1.mp4?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/a79eba7b596e077fa47d48d5336ef176.avif?t=1755076219\" width=610 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every cat is easy to spot! Some are hiding behind riddles, locked doors, or curious contraptions just waiting to be figured out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever puzzles, decode clues, and uncover hidden pathways to reveal even more elusive feline friends. Every puzzle you crack brings you one paw closer to completing your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b99d51f4a38299bf69c280c3290f26ba.poster.avif?t=1755076219\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b99d51f4a38299bf69c280c3290f26ba.webm?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/b99d51f4a38299bf69c280c3290f26ba.mp4?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/392d037d629db64fae4da5687ec1cd71.avif?t=1755076219\" width=610 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind as you take a peaceful journey through atmospheric locations filled with charm and mystery, and, of course, cats. From the sun-soaked sands of Ancient Egypt to the intimate streets of modern Japan, and the quiet corners of majestic medieval castles, each destination invites you to slow down, look closer, and discover every hidden furball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/7bc731cb1b12a0a3701d45836e909636.poster.avif?t=1755076219\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/7bc731cb1b12a0a3701d45836e909636.webm?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170490/extras/7bc731cb1b12a0a3701d45836e909636.mp4?t=1755076219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
